Training a model to to understand the world is harder than training it to solve a world-class math problem.

@Cohere_Labs took that a step further and released CulturalRiddles, a novel benchmark of original, culturally-grounded riddles written by locals - spanning 62 countries and 51 languages. Made possible through open science.

See if you’re smarter than AI with our CulturalRiddles game that tests how well you know riddles from all regions of the world: https://t.co/Ls7xf5rrHp

How much of your agent harness still needs to be there?

@_philschmid of @GoogleDeepMind shows how bash and a filesystem can cover background work, subagents and memory.

